#: schema.json
msgctxt "fh"
msgid "Link to the source code repository, e.g. https://github.com/acme/project, shown as icon in the header"
msgstr "តំណទៅឃ្លាំងកូដប្រភព ឧ. https://github.com/acme/project ដែលបង្ហាញជារូបតំណាងនៅក្បាលទំព័រ"

#. config.project.language
